<view class="ident">
  <button class="plain-btn avatar-btn" open-type="chooseAvatar" bind:chooseavatar="onChooseAvatar">
    <image class="avatar" src="{{avatarUrl}}" wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"></image>
    <view class="avatar avatar-ph" wx:else>
      <text>点头像</text>
    </view>
  </button>

  <view class="ident-main">
    <input
      class="nick"
      type="nickname"
      value="{{nickName}}"
      placeholder="填个昵称（可不填）"
      placeholder-class="nick-ph"
      bindblur="onNick"
      bindconfirm="onNick"
    />
    <text class="ident-hint">昵称与头像只存在你自己的设备上，不做授权弹窗</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="stats">
  <view class="stat">
    <text class="stat-n">{{stats.streak}}</text>
    <text class="stat-l">连续打卡（天）</text>
  </view>
  <view class="stat">
    <text class="stat-n">{{stats.terms}}</text>
    <text class="stat-l">看过的术语</text>
  </view>
  <view class="stat">
    <text class="stat-n">{{stats.scientists}}</text>
    <text class="stat-l">读过的科学家</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-title">学习档案</view>
<view class="card prog">
  <view class="prog-row">
    <view class="prog-head">
      <text class="prog-name">科学家</text>
      <text class="prog-val">{{stats.scientists}} / {{totalScientists}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="prog-bar"><view class="prog-fill" style="width: {{sciPct}}%"></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="prog-row">
    <view class="prog-head">
      <text class="prog-name">术语</text>
      <text class="prog-val">{{stats.terms}} / {{totalTerms}}</text>
    </view>
    <view class="prog-bar"><view class="prog-fill" style="width: {{termPct}}%"></view></view>
  </view>
  <view class="prog-note">
    <text>只有你自己能看到这些数字——个人主体不做公开排行榜。</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="section-title">设置</view>
<view class="card list">
  <view class="row" bindtap="goGlossary" hover-class="row-hover">
    <text class="row-t">去查术语</text>
    <text class="row-a">词典 ›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="showPrivacy" hover-class="row-hover">
    <text class="row-t">隐私说明</text>
    <text class="row-a">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="showAbout" hover-class="row-hover">
    <text class="row-t">关于与内容来源</text>
    <text class="row-a">›</text>
  </view>
  <view class="row" bindtap="resetLocal" hover-class="row-hover">
    <text class="row-t">清空本机记录</text>
    <text class="row-a">›</text>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="cloud {{cloudReady ? 'ok' : ''}}">
  <text wx:if="{{cloudReady}}">云端档案已连接：进度会跟人走（换设备也能接着读）</text>
  <text wx:else>云端档案未连接：进度暂存在本机。{{cloudHint}}</text>
</view>

<view class="foot">
  <text>读懂科学家 · 个人主体非经营性小程序</text>
  <text class="foot-2">备案号（备案通过后填写）</text>
</view>
